        <p style="font-family:arial,helvetica,san-serif;"><span style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration-color:#ffffff;text-decoration-line:inherit;">We are the national sporting organisation representing the interests of adaptive snow sports, alpine ski racing, cross country skiing, freeride, freeskiing and snowboarding in New Zealand.</span></p><p style="font-family:arial,helvetica,san-serif;"><span style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration-color:#ffffff;text-decoration-line:inherit;">Our purpose is to fuel the competitive stoke, from grassroots to elite competition, to enable snow sports athletes to succeed on the world stage.</span></p>
