        <h2 class="site-secondary-heading" style="font-family:arial black,gadget,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration-color:#ffffff;text-decoration-line:inherit;">Adaptive Snow Sports</span></h2><p><span style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration-color:#ffffff;text-decoration-line:inherit;"></span><span style="color:#f3f3f3;text-decoration-color:#f3f3f3;text-decoration-line:inherit;">Adaptive snow sports is about adapting sports environments and equipment to allow people with a wide range of disabilities to experience the freedom of snow sports. It’s about ensuring people with disabilities can ride the mountains like everyone else. </span><span style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration-color:#ffffff;text-decoration-line:inherit;"></span></p>
