        <h2 class="site-secondary-heading" style="font-family:arial black,gadget,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration-color:#ffffff;text-decoration-line:inherit;">Alpine Ski Racing</span></h2><p><span style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration-color:#ffffff;text-decoration-line:inherit;"></span><span style="color:#f3f3f3;text-decoration-color:#f3f3f3;text-decoration-line:inherit;">Alpine ski racing involves athletes racing down snow-covered slopes at high speeds, navigating their way through sets of gates to achieve the fastest time. It tests speed, agility and technique across six main disciplines. </span><span style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration-color:#ffffff;text-decoration-line:inherit;"></span></p>
    </div>
</div>

